<view class="wx-page">
  <nav-bar title="衣物预览" showBack="{{true}}"></nav-bar>

  <view class="content">
    <view class="subtitle">系统已完成自动抠图与方向矫正，请确认品类后生成试穿。</view>

    <view class="photo-card">
      <image src="/assets/img/p11-garment.jpg" mode="widthFix" />
      <view class="badge-cut">已自动抠图</view>
    </view>

    <view class="sec-hd" style="margin-top:36rpx">
      <text class="sec-title">品类识别</text>
      <text class="hint">已自动识别</text>
    </view>
    <view class="cat-result">
      <view class="rec-badge">{{category || '识别中...'}}</view>
      <text class="cat-note">系统已自动识别衣物类型</text>
    </view>

    <view class="step-note">非衣物、多人合照或涉敏图片会被拦截，不会进入生成流程。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="footer-bar">
    <btn class="footer-main" type="primary" bindtap="confirm">确认生成试穿</btn>
  </view>

  <tab-bar selected="{{1}}" navMode="{{true}}"></tab-bar>
</view>
